id=tissot_susfs_hide
name=tissot SUSFS hide
version=v2.2.0-tissot
versionCode=202000
author=QunDev
description=SUSFS root-hiding + boot-state prop spoof for tissot (KernelSU-Next, susfs v2.1.0). Hides KSU/modules from apps, spoofs AVC logs, and resetprop-spoofs ro.boot.verifiedbootstate(green)/flash.locked/vbmeta to defeat prop-based bootloader checks. Auto-runs every boot via post-fs-data.d. NOTE: does not defeat hardware TEE key attestation.
